   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOLICO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MOLICO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatens &#xF6;vergripande syfte &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka det system som etablerats av moldaviska regeringen f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rebygga och kontrollera korruption, penningtv&#xE4;tt och finansiering av terrorism in i linje med till&#xE4;mpbara internationella standard och praxis. Inom projektet kommer moldaviska myndigheter att genomf&#xF6;ra den nationalla anti-korruptionsstrategin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen the system established by Moldovan Government to contribute to the prevention and control of corruption, money laundering and the financing of terrorism in accordance with international standards and practice and the recommendations of Moneyval. The project will assist the Moldovan authorities to implement the national anti-corruption strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
